{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00389","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享昊天乐章 十 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享昊天乐章 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃肃祀典，邕邕礼秩。\n三献已周，九成斯毕。\n爰撤其俎，载迁其实。\n或升或降，唯诚唯质。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}